"armor-mods\t不稳定齐射\t梦魇根源":"<p>使用<span class=\"el-void\">虚空</span>分支职业时：<br> 用<span class=\"el-void\">虚空</span>武器击杀<span class=\"bar-orange\">橙血</span>、<span class=\"bar-yellow\">初级首领</span>或<span class=\"enemy\">勇士</span>：<br> 获得<span class=\"perk\">不稳定弹药</span>，持续 10.5 秒。<br> <br> <span class=\"note\">触发后有 10 秒冷却。</span></p>",
"armor-mods\t专注打击\t护臂":"<p>造成充能近战伤害时：<br> 提供<span class=\"pickup\">职业技能能量</span>。<br> <br> 技能能量获取：<br> 12%<span class=\"pvp\">[6%]</span> ｜ 17%<span class=\"pvp\">[8.5%]</span> ｜ 20%<span class=\"pvp\">[10%]</span><br> <br> <span class=\"note\">触发后有 7 秒冷却。</span></p>",
"armor-mods\t临危不乱\t克洛塔的末日":"<p>站在踏板上、靠近踏板或图腾，或携带圣物利剑时：<br> <span class=\"unsure\">?%</span> ｜ <span class=\"unsure\">?%</span> ｜ <span class=\"unsure\">?%</span> ｜ <span class=\"unsure\">?%</span> ｜ <span class=\"unsure\">?%</span> 伤害抗性。</p>",
"armor-mods\t仁慈满溢\t克洛塔的末日":"<p>处于光能环绕状态，且圣杯被夺走或使用者死亡时：<br> 在使用者周围释放一次治疗爆发。<br> <br> <span class=\"unsure\">?</span> ｜ <span class=\"unsure\">?</span> ｜ <span class=\"unsure\">?</span> ｜ <span class=\"unsure\">?</span> ｜ <span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 点<span class=\"health\">生命值</span><br> <span class=\"unsure\">?</span> ｜ <span class=\"unsure\">?</span> ｜ <span class=\"unsure\">?</span> ｜ <span class=\"unsure\">?</span> ｜ <span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 米半径</p>",
"armor-mods\t仁慈终结技\t职业物品":"<p>使用<span class=\"enemy\">终结技</span>时：<br> 消耗 <span class=\"armor-charge\">x3 护甲充能</span>。<br> <br> 为<span class=\"enemy\">盟友</span>生成一枚<span class=\"orb\">能量球</span>，提供 7.15% <span class=\"orb\">超能能量</span>。</p>",
