"armor-mods\t虹吸\t头盔":"<p>3 秒内用与模组元素相同的武器连续击杀 2 名<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>：<br> 生成一枚<span class=\"orb\">能量球</span>。<br> <br> <span class=\"orb\">能量球</span>：<br> 2.5% ｜ 3.75% ｜ 4.4% <span class=\"orb\">超能能量</span>。<br> <br> <span class=\"note\">生成能量球后有 1 秒冷却，冷却期间的击杀不计数。</span></p>",
"armor-mods\t虹吸雕文守护者\t门徒誓约":"<p>击杀雕文<span class=\"bar-orange\">守护者</span>时：<br> 提供<span class=\"pickup\">手雷技能能量</span>、<span class=\"pickup\">职业技能能量</span>与<span class=\"orb\">超能能量</span>。<br> <br> 获取量：<br> <span class=\"unsure\">?%</span> ｜ <span class=\"unsure\">?%</span> ｜ <span class=\"unsure\">?%</span> ｜ <span class=\"unsure\">?%</span> ｜ <span class=\"unsure\">?%</span></p>",
"armor-mods\t装弹装置\t护臂":"<p>对与模组元素相同的武器，取出约 0.5 秒后：<br> <br> +10 ｜ +15 ｜ +18 填装速度<br> 填装时长 ×0.85</p>",
"armor-mods\t触手可及\t救赎的边缘":"<p>在距肢体 <span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 米内击杀<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>：<br> 提供 <span class=\"unsure\">?%</span> <span class=\"orb\">超能能量</span>。</p>",
