"elements/arc\t信标火花\t异域词条":"<p><span class=\"el-arc\">增幅</span>期间：<br>用<span class=\"ammo-special\">特殊弹药</span>与<span class=\"ammo-heavy\">威能弹药</span>的<span class=\"el-arc\">电弧</span>武器击杀会产生<span class=\"deb-arc\">致盲</span>爆炸，对 7.5 米内的<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>施加<span class=\"deb-arc\">致盲</span>。</p>",
"elements/arc\t信标火花\t碎片":"<p class=\"v\">碎片消耗 1</p><p><span class=\"el-arc\">增幅</span>期间：<br>用<span class=\"ammo-special\">特殊弹药</span>与<span class=\"ammo-heavy\">威能弹药</span>的<span class=\"el-arc\">电弧</span>武器击杀会产生<span class=\"deb-arc\">致盲</span>爆炸，对 7.5 米内的<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>施加<span class=\"deb-arc\">致盲</span>。</p>",
"elements/arc\t充能火花\t异域词条":"<p>进入重伤时：<br><span class=\"pickup\">手雷与近战技能</span>基础充能速度额外 +400%<span class=\"pvp\">[200%]</span>，持续到护盾完全恢复为止。</p>",
