"shopping-primary\t冲击支撑\t异域词条":"<p>对受<span class=\"el-void\">虚空</span><span class=\"debuff\">减益</span>的<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>造成武器击杀时：<br>获得<span class=\"el-void\">虚空覆盖护盾</span>，持续 8+4 <span class=\"enh\">↑9</span>+4.5 秒。</p>",
"shopping-primary\t冷却饰物\t异域词条":"<p>拾取元素拾取物或<span class=\"orb\">超能能量球</span>时：<br>发热量消散 -33<span class=\"unsure\">?</span>% <span class=\"enh\">↑-35%</span>。</p>",
"shopping-primary\t减员激励\t异域词条":"<p>进入重伤或队友阵亡时：<br>获得 <span class=\"stack\">1 层</span><span class=\"perk\">减员激励</span>，最多 <span class=\"stack\">10 层</span>。<br><span class=\"perk\">减员激励</span>最多提供 +35 稳定性、+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 操控性与 +<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 瞄准辅助。<br>层数在死亡前一直保留。收枪状态下可触发。</p><p><span class=\"perk\">减员激励</span>：<br>+6｜+14｜+19｜+23｜+27｜+29｜+31｜+33｜+34｜+35 稳定性。<br>+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span>｜+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span>｜+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span>｜+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span>｜+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span>｜+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span>｜+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span>｜+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span>｜+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span>｜+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 操控性。<br>+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span>｜+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span>｜+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span>｜+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span>｜+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span>｜+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span>｜+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span>｜+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span>｜+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span>｜+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 瞄准辅助</p>",
"shopping-primary\t分离\t异域词条":"<p>摧毁载具类<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>、构造体或打破护盾时：<br>+40 <span class=\"enh\">↑</span>+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 填装速度，填装时长倍率 0.95×，蓄力时间倍率 0.9× <span class=\"enh\">↑0</span>.<span class=\"unsure\">?</span>×，持续 7 秒。<br>收枪后<span class=\"buff\">增益</span>仍然保留。</p>",
"shopping-primary\t分裂\t手枪":"<p class=\"v\">变焦 +12每分钟发射数 +30伤害 +80射程 +50稳定性 +39弹匣 +30填装速度 +24弹药生成 +33操控性 +33辅助瞄准 +87后坐方向 +97空中效率 +23</p>",
"shopping-primary\t切分音-53\t脉冲步枪":"<p class=\"v\">变焦 +19每分钟发射数 +70伤害 +30射程 +46稳定性 +59弹匣 +60填装速度 +42弹药生成 +45操控性 +46辅助瞄准 +66后坐方向 +79空中效率 +14</p>",
"shopping-primary\t切割\t异域词条":"<p>使用职业技能时：<br>此后每 8 <span class=\"enh\">↑9</span> 秒内，对未被<span class=\"deb-strand\">割裂</span>的<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>造成的接下来 5 次伤害施加<span class=\"deb-strand\">割裂</span>。<br>对未被<span class=\"deb-strand\">割裂</span>的<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>造成伤害会刷新该<span class=\"buff\">增益</span>持续时间。<br>收枪期间也能激活该<span class=\"buff\">增益</span>，且收枪后保留。<br>若造成<span class=\"deb-strand\">割裂</span>的那次命中击杀了<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>，该 Perk 不会触发，也不消耗层数。可对免疫的<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>施加<span class=\"deb-strand\">割裂</span>。</p>",
"shopping-primary\t切勿靠近\t异域词条":"<p>15 米内没有<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>时：<br>+10 射程，+30 <span class=\"enh\">↑+35</span> 填装速度，精度锥增长 -5<span class=\"unsure\">?</span>% <span class=\"enh\">↑</span>-<span class=\"unsure\">?</span>%。</p>",
