"shopping-primary\t庄家之选\t异域词条":"<p>武器击杀提供额外超能技能能量。<br>装备更多<span class=\"perk\">庄家之选</span>武器会提高获得的超能技能能量。</p><p>x1 = +0.3% <span class=\"enh\">↑</span>+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span>%｜x2 = +1.6% <span class=\"enh\">↑</span>+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span>%｜x3 = +3% <span class=\"enh\">↑</span>+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span>% 超能技能能量。</p><p>以下<span class=\"exotic\">异域</span>武器计入<span class=\"perk\">庄家之选</span>武器数量，但自身不获得超能技能能量加成。<br><span class=\"exotic\">黑桃 A</span>｜<span class=\"exotic\">赫沃斯托夫 7G-0X</span><br><span class=\"exotic\">故我在</span>｜<span class=\"exotic\">隐秘追猎</span><br><span class=\"exotic\">缩影</span></p>",
