"shopping-primary\t活性放射体液转换器\t异域词条":"<p>以每次间隔 8 秒内的武器击杀把计数推进至 100% 时：<br><span class=\"bar-red\">红血</span> = 34% ｜ <span class=\"bar-orange\">橙血</span>及以上 = 100% ｜ <span class=\"bar-orange\">守护者</span> = <span class=\"unsure\">?</span>%<br>收枪会重置计数。</p><p>目标爆炸，在 3<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 米范围内造成至多 67.5 <span class=\"unsure\">[?]</span> 伤害，并在其脚下生成一滩活性放射体液。<br>活性放射体液每 0.65 秒在 <span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 米范围内造成 15 <span class=\"unsure\">[?]</span> <span class=\"el-arc\">电弧</span>伤害，持续 <span class=\"unsure\">?</span> <span class=\"enh\">↑</span><span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 秒，至多 3<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 次。<br>对<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>的伤害随<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>等级修正缩放。计为武器伤害，并受伤害<span class=\"buff\">增益</span>影响。</p>",
