"shopping-primary\t超因果亲和\t异域词条":"<p>造成与阵营属性一致的元素击杀时：<br>伤害提高 20%，持续 6 <span class=\"enh\">↑7</span> 秒。<br>用阵营属性一致的来源继续击杀刷新<span class=\"buff\">增益</span>持续时间。<br>收枪状态下也可触发，收枪后保留。</p><p>光明阵营 = <span class=\"el-arc\">电弧</span>、<span class=\"el-solar\">烈日</span>与<span class=\"el-void\">虚空</span>。<br>黑暗阵营 = <span class=\"el-stasis\">冰影</span>与<span class=\"el-strand\">缚丝</span>。</p><p><span class=\"enh\">↑</span><span class=\"buff\">增益</span>持续时间延长至 7 秒。</p>",
"shopping-primary\t超因果流体\t异域词条":"<p>造成伤害时：<br>获得<span class=\"perk\">超因果流体</span>，持续 3 秒。<br>收枪后该<span class=\"buff\">增益</span>仍然生效。</p><p><span class=\"perk\">超因果流体</span> ｜ +<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> <span class=\"enh\">↑</span>+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 操控性、+50 敏捷，+90 <span class=\"enh\">↑</span>+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 充能效率。</p>",
