"shopping-special\tOmolon流体动力\t异域词条":"<p>弹匣的前 50% 内：<br>最多提供 +20 <span class=\"enh\">↑</span>+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 稳定性与 +30 <span class=\"enh\">↑</span>+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 填装速度。<br>随着弹匣消耗至 50%，加成线性递减。</p>",
