"shopping-special\t二元轨道\t异域词条":"<p>造成相反属性元素击杀时：<br>伤害提高 25%，持续 8.5 <span class=\"enh\">↑10.5</span> 秒。<br>再次以相反属性的来源击杀可刷新<span class=\"buff\">增益</span>持续时间。<br>收枪期间可触发，且收枪后保留。</p><p><span class=\"el-arc\">电弧</span>、<span class=\"el-solar\">烈日</span>或<span class=\"el-void\">虚空</span>击杀 --> <span class=\"el-kinetic\">动能</span>、<span class=\"el-stasis\">冰影</span>与<span class=\"el-strand\">缚丝</span>武器获得<span class=\"buff\">增益</span>。<br><span class=\"el-kinetic\">动能</span>、<span class=\"el-stasis\">冰影</span>或<span class=\"el-strand\">缚丝</span>击杀 --> <span class=\"el-arc\">电弧</span>、<span class=\"el-solar\">烈日</span>与<span class=\"el-void\">虚空</span>武器获得<span class=\"buff\">增益</span>。</p>",
