"shopping-special\t冰冷弹匣\t异域词条":"<p>弹匣容量在 50% <span class=\"enh\">↑40%</span> 及以上时：<br>直击命中触发<span class=\"el-stasis\">冰影</span>爆发，对 4<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 米内的<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>施加 x60 <span class=\"deb-stasis\">减速</span>，持续 4+4 <span class=\"pvp\">[1.5+0.5]</span> 秒。<br>速射融合步枪与火箭手枪施加 x40 <span class=\"deb-stasis\">减速</span>。<br>每次射击只能触发一次。</p>",
