"shopping-special\t冲击支撑\t异域词条":"<p>对受<span class=\"el-void\">虚空</span><span class=\"debuff\">减益</span>的<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>造成武器击杀时：<br>获得<span class=\"el-void\">虚空覆盖护盾</span>，持续 8+4 <span class=\"enh\">↑9</span>+4.5 秒。</p>",
"shopping-special\t冷却饰物\t异域词条":"<p>拾取元素拾取物或<span class=\"orb\">超能能量球</span>时：<br>发热量消散 -33<span class=\"unsure\">?</span>% <span class=\"enh\">↑-35%</span>。</p>",
