"weapon-perks\t帝国效忠\t异域词条":"<p>15 米内每有一名队友，提供 <span class=\"stack\">1 层</span><span class=\"perk\">帝国效忠</span>，最多 <span class=\"stack\">3 层</span>。</p><p>每层<span class=\"perk\">帝国效忠</span>提供 1.035× 冷却倍率与 +<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 充能效率。<br>此外，发热量高于 50%／刀剑能量低于 <span class=\"unsure\">?</span>% 时，每层提供 3.5% <span class=\"unsure\">[?%]</span> 的伤害提升。</p><p><span class=\"perk\">帝国效忠</span> x1｜1.035× 冷却倍率、+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 充能效率，伤害提高 3.5% <span class=\"unsure\">[?%]</span>。<br><span class=\"perk\">帝国效忠</span> x2｜1.07× 冷却倍率、+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 充能效率，伤害提高 7% <span class=\"unsure\">[?%]</span>。<br><span class=\"perk\">帝国效忠</span> x3｜1.105× 冷却倍率、+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 充能效率，伤害提高 10.5% <span class=\"unsure\">[?%]</span>。</p>",
