"weapon-perks\t征服\t异域词条":"<p>造成伤害时，Perk 效果随目标的等级变化：</p><p>对<span class=\"bar-red\">红血</span>与<span class=\"bar-orange\">橙血</span><span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>：<br>射击命中时爆炸，以<span class=\"perk\">高爆载荷</span>的形式造成 6.5（霰弹枪为 32.5 <span class=\"enh\">↑</span><span class=\"unsure\">?</span>）额外伤害，伤及 3<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 米内的<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>。<br>追踪步枪：命中 4 次后，每 4 次命中触发一次。<br>对<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>的伤害随<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>等级修正缩放，并计为武器伤害。<br><span class=\"enh\">↑</span>爆炸伤害提高 25%。</p><p>对<span class=\"enemy\">勇士</span>、<span class=\"bar-yellow\">初级首领</span>与<span class=\"bar-yellow\">首领</span>：<br>命中时施加疲惫，持续 5 秒，使<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>输出伤害降低 25%。</p><p><span class=\"bar-orange\">守护者</span>：<br><span class=\"unsure\">?</span>% 受击抖动抗性，持续 <span class=\"unsure\">?</span> <span class=\"enh\">↑</span><span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 秒。</p>",
"weapon-perks\t征服\t起源特性":"<p>造成伤害时，Perk 效果随目标的等级变化：</p><p>对<span class=\"bar-red\">红血</span>与<span class=\"bar-orange\">橙血</span><span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>：<br>射击命中时爆炸，以<span class=\"perk\">高爆载荷</span>的形式造成 6.5（霰弹枪为 32.5 <span class=\"enh\">↑</span><span class=\"unsure\">?</span>）额外伤害，伤及 3<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 米内的<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>。<br>追踪步枪：命中 4 次后，每 4 次命中触发一次。<br>对<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>的伤害随<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>等级修正缩放，并计为武器伤害。<br><span class=\"enh\">↑</span>爆炸伤害提高 25%。</p><p>对<span class=\"enemy\">勇士</span>、<span class=\"bar-yellow\">初级首领</span>与<span class=\"bar-yellow\">首领</span>：<br>命中时施加疲惫，持续 5 秒，使<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>输出伤害降低 25%。</p><p><span class=\"bar-orange\">守护者</span>：<br><span class=\"unsure\">?</span>% 受击抖动抗性，持续 <span class=\"unsure\">?</span> <span class=\"enh\">↑</span><span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 秒。</p>",
"weapon-perks\t徒手握把\t异域词条":"<p>-30% <span class=\"enh\">↑-30%</span> 腰射精度锥大小。<br>举枪动画时长倍率 0.95× <span class=\"enh\">↑</span><span class=\"unsure\">0.?×</span>。</p>",
"weapon-perks\t徒手握把\t武器模组":"<p>-30% <span class=\"enh\">↑-30%</span> 腰射精度锥大小。<br>举枪动画时长倍率 0.95× <span class=\"enh\">↑</span><span class=\"unsure\">0.?×</span>。</p>",
