"weapon-perks\t御寒装备\t起源特性":"<p>获得<span class=\"perk\">御寒装备</span>就绪。<br>造成或受到伤害时转变为<span class=\"perk\">御寒装备</span> <span class=\"stack\">3 层</span>。<br><span class=\"perk\">御寒装备</span>结束 12 秒后重新获得<span class=\"perk\">御寒装备</span>就绪。</p><p><span class=\"perk\">御寒装备</span> <span class=\"stack\">3 层</span> = +<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> <span class=\"enh\">↑</span>+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 稳定性、+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> <span class=\"enh\">↑</span>+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 操控性、+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> <span class=\"enh\">↑</span>+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 填装速度，持续 5 秒。<br><span class=\"perk\">御寒装备</span> <span class=\"stack\">2 层</span> = +<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> <span class=\"enh\">↑</span>+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 稳定性、+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> <span class=\"enh\">↑</span>+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 操控性、+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> <span class=\"enh\">↑</span>+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 填装速度，持续 5 秒。<br><span class=\"perk\">御寒装备</span> <span class=\"stack\">1 层</span> = +<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> <span class=\"enh\">↑</span>+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 稳定性、+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> <span class=\"enh\">↑</span>+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 操控性、+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> <span class=\"enh\">↑</span>+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 填装速度，持续 5 秒。</p>",
"weapon-perks\t微型导弹框架\t固有 PERK":"<p>发射自推进微型导弹。命中时会爆炸，造成高额伤害。</p>",
