"weapon-perks\t精细调整\t武器 PERK":"<p>发热量从 0% 上升至 50% 的过程中：<br>发热量为 0% 时提供至多 +<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> <span class=\"enh\">↑22</span><span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 射程、+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> <span class=\"enh\">↑</span>+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 操控性，以及 -<span class=\"unsure\">?</span>% <span class=\"enh\">↑</span>-<span class=\"unsure\">?</span>% 精度锥增长。<br><span class=\"buff\">增益</span>从 0% 发热量时的 100% 效果动态衰减至 50% 发热量时的 50% 效果。</p>",
