"weapon-perks\t结晶残花\t异域词条":"<p>武器击杀时：<br>获得<span class=\"perk\">结晶残花</span>，持续 4 秒。</p><p><span class=\"perk\">结晶残花</span>激活期间：<br>武器击杀会让<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>死亡时释放一枚<span class=\"el-stasis\">冰影</span>追踪弹。<br><span class=\"el-stasis\">冰影</span>追踪弹朝随机方向飞行 3<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 米，消散时生成一座中型<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> <span class=\"enh\">↑</span>大型的<span class=\"el-stasis\">冰影水晶</span>。</p>",
