"weapon-perks\t风冷核心\t起源特性":"<p>弹匣满或发热量 ≤10%<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 时：<br>+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> <span class=\"enh\">↑</span>+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 操控性，机瞄移动速度惩罚减少 <span class=\"unsure\">?</span>% <span class=\"enh\">↑</span><span class=\"unsure\">?</span>%。</p><p>冲刺 0.5 秒时：<br>+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 填装／排气速度，持续 <span class=\"unsure\">6?</span> 秒</p>",
